{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04425","headline":"题居延古城赠乔十二知之 · 陈子昂","name":"题居延古城赠乔十二知之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻君东山意，宿昔紫芝荣。\n沧洲今何在？华髪旅边城。\n还汉功既薄，逐胡策未行。\n徒嗟白日暮，坐对黄云生。\n桂枝芳欲晚，薏苡谤谁明。\n无爲空自老，含叹负生平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04425.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04425","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}